OL,3,ABaby death suspects released on bail
OL,4,
OL,5,FTwo people arrested in connection with
OL,6,Fthe death of a one-year-old girl in
OL,7,FWarwickshire have been released on
OL,8,Fbail, police say.
OL,10,FIt comes after emergency services were
OL,11,Fcalled to a house on Long Street,
OL,12,FAtherstone, at about 11:50 BST on
OL,13,FFriday to reports of a child in cardiac
OL,14,Farrest. She was pronounced dead at the
OL,15,Fscene a short while later, police said.
OL,17,FA 19-year-old woman and a man aged 21
OL,18,Fwere then both arrested at the scene on
OL,19,Fsuspicion of child neglect.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
